User Journey
The system's working process is designed to be simple and natural for users, with the following steps:
Enter Prompt:The user begins by entering a need or problem into the Prompt field.
Analyze with NLP:Natural Language Processing (NLP) systems analyze text to understand true intent and needs.
Search with AI:AI Engine searches for products that match your needs from various connected platforms.
Compare and explain:The system compares prices and generates contextual descriptions for recommended products.
Show results:The results will be displayed in 3D or 2D (depending on the user mode) with pricing information and links to purchase the product.
Continue (User Action):Users can choose to view more details, click on the link to purchase the product, orRefine the prompt to search again.
Save & Learn:The system saves searches for future learning and allows users to rate the results to improve the AI's accuracy (Feedback Loop).
This chosen architecture not only allows the MVP to be developed in real-world ways, but also offers high flexibility, allowing for future expansions with new features such as gamification or expansion into AR/VR technologies, which will be discussed in the next roadmap.
