7.0 Business Model & Monetization
MAGIC BUTTON's business model is designed to be sustainable and diversified, leveraging multi-stream monetization driven by real-world usage, user engagement, and brand partnerships. This model allows us to monetize without impacting the core user experience, but instead fostering strong growth for the overall ecosystem.
Our main revenue generating channels include:
Affiliate Commissions (affiliate commissions):The primary source of income initially will be earned through commissions when users purchase products through MAGIC BUTTON's recommended links from partner e-commerce platforms such as Shopee, Lazada, and Amazon.
Premium Features (Features for Premium Members):For Expert or Power Users, we will offer a premium membership plan that provides access to advanced features such as extra-granular search filters, in-depth comparison tools, and future AR functionality.
Sponsored Placements (Promotional space for brands):Brands will be able to purchase space to promote their products in the form of Sponsored Showcases that are prominently displayed and visually appealing within the platform, providing brands with a channel to reach a highly engaged audience.
Gamified User Rewards (Rewards and Loyalty System):We will develop a rewards system that integrates with marketing, such as awarding points or special discounts for highly engaged users, which can then be partnered with brands to launch promotional campaigns.
This diverse business model not only creates a stable revenue stream, but also fosters a healthy ecosystem between users who enjoy a better experience and brands who can effectively engage with their customers, leading to a broader positive impact and reinforcing the project's potential to become a long-term market leader.
